Category: Changed

The Neutron external interface selection logic was improved to ensure correct public network interface usage, particularly when the management network uses IP addresses in the 10.10 range. This change introduces a new check for the OS_KOLLA_NEUTRON_EXTERNAL_INTERFACE config variable and provides an error message if it's not set, preventing potential loss of external connectivity. The public_nic variable is now correctly determined based on the presence of the 10.10 network route.
